# bonus_c from '@' to the spiral staff on the podium with the hammer (both difficulties; ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K):
# the club route with each strike given the time of the hammer's 6-tick swing recovery.
# Start: club the inset tile in the road three times.
14:R,10:,10:DF,5:,10:DF,5:,10:DF,6:
# Run along the candy line and jump the first gap through the ice-cream arc.
47:R,16:RU,6:R,4:
